msgid "Triton算子开发指南"
msgstr "Triton Operator Development Guide"

msgid ""
"概述：本文着重介绍了在NPU上进行Triton算子开发中值得注意的问题，分为三个方面：多核任务并行、单核数据搬运、单核数据运算。首先在多核任务并行中介绍了设置最大硬件核数的依据以及具体的实现。然后在单核数据搬运中具体描述了如何设置合适的循环内数据分块大小，并且介绍了过程中常用的优化手段，还补充了可能面临的UB"
" OVERFLOW问题的处理方式。最后回归单个算子，在单核数据运算层面着重介绍了如何开发Triton算子，并强调了相关的关键点。"
msgstr ""
"Overview: This article focuses on notable issues in Triton operator "
"development on NPU, divided into three aspects: multi-core task parallelism,"
" single-core data movement, and single-core data computation. First, it "
"introduces the basis for setting the maximum number of hardware cores and "
"the specific implementation in multi-core task parallelism. Then, it details"
" how to set an appropriate data chunk size within loops during single-core "
"data movement, introduces common optimization techniques used in the "
"process, and supplements the handling of potential UB OVERFLOW issues. "
"Finally, it returns to a single operator, focusing on how to develop Triton "
"operators at the single-core data computation level, and emphasizes the "
"relevant key points."

msgid "文档组织"
msgstr "Document Organization"

msgid "本指南将通用开发原则和按硬件执行单元划分的算子开发路径分开组织："
msgstr ""
"This guide separates general development principles from operator "
"development paths organized by hardware execution units:"

msgid "本页介绍所有 Triton-Ascend 算子都需要关注的通用问题，包括分核、片上内存、访存、Tiling 和 Autotune。"
msgstr ""
"This page introduces common issues that all Triton-Ascend operators need to "
"pay attention to, including core partitioning, on-chip memory, memory "
"access, Tiling, and Autotune."

msgid ""
"[Vector 算子开发](./vector_operator.md) 介绍主要由 Vector Core "
"执行的逐元素、归约、Gather/Scatter 等算子。"
msgstr ""
"[Vector Operator Development](./vector_operator.md) introduces operators "
"such as element-wise, reduction, Gather/Scatter, etc., primarily executed by"
" the Vector Core."

msgid "[Cube 算子开发](./cube_operator.md) 介绍以 `tl.dot`、矩阵乘、批量矩阵乘为核心的算子。"
msgstr ""
"[Cube Operator Development](./cube_operator.md) introduces operators "
"centered around `tl.dot`, matrix multiplication, and batched matrix "
"multiplication."

msgid ""
"[CV 融合算子开发](./cv_fusion_operator.md) 介绍同一个算子中同时存在 Cube 计算和 Vector "
"后处理、归约、Softmax 或跨核协同的场景。"
msgstr ""
"[CV Fusion Operator Development](./cv_fusion_operator.md) introduces "
"scenarios where Cube computation and Vector post-processing, reduction, "
"Softmax, or cross-core collaboration coexist within the same operator."

msgid ""
"简单算子优先参考本仓 `docs/zh/examples/` 和 `third_party/ascend/tutorials/`；复杂算子优先参考 "
"GitHub 上的 [Ascend/triton-ascend-ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend-ops) 中 `tutorial/best_practice/` 的完整优化案例。"
msgstr ""
"For simple operators, refer primarily to `docs/zh/examples/` and "
"`third_party/ascend/tutorials/` in this repository; for complex operators, "
"refer primarily to the complete optimization cases in "
"`tutorial/best_practice/` under [Ascend/triton-ascend-"
"ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops) on GitHub."

msgid "通用多核任务并行"
msgstr "Generic multi-core task parallelism"

msgid "设置最大硬件核数"
msgstr "Set the maximum number of hardware cores."

msgid ""
"在一个Triton算子中，通常使用grid进行分核操作。对于GPU而言，其计算核心SM通常是几十到几百量级。但是对于昇腾NPU平台而言，其计算核心AI "
"Core的数量在几十个的量级。 "
"虽然运行时接口允许下发并发任务数最大为65535，但超过物理核数的部分是通过新一轮的下发来完成的。如果直接将GPU上的Triton算子拿到昇腾平台上运行，这些大量的任务会引入可观的核启动和核初始化时的额外开销，影响到算子性能表现。"
" 因此，需要针对昇腾平台特性修改分核逻辑。最推荐的做法是**将分核的数量直接固定为硬件的物理核数**，在核内做更为细致的数据分块："
msgstr ""
"In a Triton operator, the grid is typically used for core partitioning. For "
"GPUs, the number of compute cores (SMs) is typically on the order of tens to"
" hundreds. However, for the Ascend NPU platform, the number of compute cores"
" (AI Cores) is on the order of tens. Although the runtime interface allows "
"dispatching up to 65535 concurrent tasks, tasks exceeding the number of "
"physical cores are completed through additional dispatch rounds. If you "
"directly run a GPU Triton operator on the Ascend Platform, the large number "
"of tasks introduces significant kernel launch and core initialization "
"overhead, affecting operator performance. Therefore, you need to modify the "
"core partitioning logic to suit the characteristics of the Ascend Platform. "
"The most recommended approach is to **directly set the number of core "
"partitions to the number of physical cores on the hardware** and perform "
"more fine-grained data tiling within each core:"

msgid "<br />\n"
msgstr "<br />\n"

msgid "\\\\\n"
msgstr "\\\\\n"

msgid "对于纯Vector算子，分核数等于**Vector核数量**。"
msgstr ""
"For pure Vector operators, the number of split cores equals the **number of "
"Vector cores**."

msgid "对于CV融合算子，分核数等于**Cube核数量**（通常为Vector核数量的一半），算子执行时会按1：2的比例调用Vector核。"
msgstr ""
"For CV fusion operators, the number of split cores equals the **number of "
"Cube cores** (usually half the number of Vector cores). During operator "
"execution, Vector cores are invoked at a 1:2 ratio."

msgid ""
"一般而言，在NPU卡上，一个计算核心AI "
"Core含有一个Cube核，每个Cube核配有两个Vector核，因此可以通过以下接口获取**Vector核数(vectorcore_num)**与**Cube核数量(aicore_num)**："
msgstr ""
"Generally, on an NPU card, a compute core (AI Core) contains one Cube core, "
"and each Cube core is equipped with two Vector cores. Therefore, you can "
"obtain the **number of Vector cores (vectorcore_num)** and **number of Cube "
"cores (aicore_num)** through the following interface:"

msgid ""
"import torch\n"
"import triton.runtime.driver as driver\n"
"import torch_npu\n"
"\n"
"device = torch_npu.npu.current_device()\n"
"properties = driver.active.utils.get_device_properties(device)\n"
"vectorcore_num = properties[\"num_vectorcore\"]\n"
"aicore_num = properties[\"num_aicore\"]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"import torch\n"
"import triton.runtime.driver as driver\n"
"import torch_npu\n"
"\n"
"device = torch_npu.npu.current_device()\n"
"properties = driver.active.utils.get_device_properties(device)\n"
