msgid ""
"通过分析表格中的数据可以发现，优化前后的aiv_mte2_time(us)和aiv_mte2_ratio差距较大，优化方案通过先将大部分数据搬运到UB上，减少小批量数据通过L2搬运到UB的次数，减少了L2搬运到UB上的总时间。"
msgstr ""
"By analyzing the data in the table, it can be observed that there is a "
"significant difference in aiv_mte2_time(us) and aiv_mte2_ratio before and "
"after optimization. The optimization scheme first moves most of the data to "
"UB, reducing the number of times small batches of data are moved to UB via "
"L2, thereby decreasing the total time for L2-to-UB data transfer."

msgid "存算并行"
msgstr "Compute-Storage Parallelism"

msgid "Triton-Ascend支持两种数据处理模式：存算串行和存算并行。"
msgstr ""
"Triton-Ascend supports two data processing modes: storage-compute serial and"
" storage-compute parallel."

msgid "存算串行：先从全局内存搬运数据到片上内存，完成计算后，再搬运下一批数据。这种方式存在明显的空闲等待时间，效率较低。"
msgstr ""
"Load-compute serial: first move data from global memory to on-chip memory, "
"complete the computation, then move the next batch of data. This approach "
"has obvious idle waiting time and is less efficient."

msgid ""
"存算并行：在搬运第一批数据至片上内存的同时，已开始对其执行计算；随后继续搬运第二批数据，形成“搬运+计算”重叠的流水线式操作，显著提升整体吞吐率。"
msgstr ""
"Compute-in-parallel: While transferring the first batch of data to on-chip "
"memory, computation on it has already begun; subsequently, the second batch "
"of data is transferred, forming a pipelined operation where \"transfer + "
"compute\" overlap, significantly improving overall throughput."

msgid ""
"实现存算并行的关键在于合理设计数据切分（Tiling）策略，使得在当前批次数据计算过程中，能够提前准备下一阶段所需的数据，从而实现数据搬运与计算过程的并行化。目前，编译器默认配置multiBuffer=True，默认支持存算并行。"
msgstr ""
"The key to achieving memory-compute parallelism is to properly design a data"
" tiling strategy. This enables the data required for the next stage to be "
"prepared in advance during the computation of the current batch, thereby "
"parallelizing data movement and computation. Currently, the compiler "
"defaults to multiBuffer=True, supporting memory-compute parallelism by "
"default."

msgid "Tiling优化"
msgstr "Tiling optimization"

msgid ""
"AI Core进行计算的时候要先将数据搬运至片上内存，而片上内存的空间通常远小于AI Core要处理的总数据量，以Atlas 800T/I "
"A2产品为例，片上内存容量为192KB，默认开启doublebuffer特性后容量还会减至原来的一半。因此算子计算时需要对数据进行分块操作，每次只加载处理其中的一小部分数据。"
msgstr ""
"When AI Core performs computation, data must first be moved to on-chip "
"memory, and the space of on-chip memory is usually much smaller than the "
"total amount of data that AI Core needs to process. Taking the Atlas 800T/I "
"A2 product as an example, the on-chip memory capacity is 192KB, and after "
"the double buffer feature is enabled by default, the capacity is reduced to "
"half of the original. Therefore, during operator computation, data needs to "
"be divided into blocks, and only a small portion of the data is loaded and "
"processed at a time."

msgid ""
"@libentry()\n"
"@triton.autotune(configs=runtime.get_tuned_config(\"masked_fill\"), key=[\"N\"])\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"- def masked_fill_kernel(inp, expand_mask, value, out, N, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n"
"+ def masked_fill_kernel(inp, expand_mask, value, out, N, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr, BLOCK_SIZE_SUB: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)\n"
"+   base_offset = pid * BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"\n"
"+   # Compute the total number of blocks to process\n"
"+   num_sub_blocks = tl.cdiv(BLOCK_SIZE, BLOCK_SIZE_SUB)\n"
"\n"
"+   # Process each sub-block in a loop\n"
"+   for sub_block_idx in range(num_sub_blocks):\n"
"+       # Compute the offset of the current sub-block\n"
"+       sub_offset = base_offset + sub_block_idx * BLOCK_SIZE_SUB\n"
"+       offsets = sub_offset + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE_SUB)\n"
"-       offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"        mask = offsets < N\n"
"        # Load input and mask\n"
"        input_vals = tl.load(inp + offsets, mask=mask, other=0)\n"
"        fill_mask_vals = tl.load(expand_mask + offsets, mask=mask, other=0).to(tl.int1)\n"
"\n"
"        # Write the original input first\n"
"        tl.store(out + offsets, input_vals, mask=mask)\n"
"\n"
"        # Overlay and write value at the position that needs to be filled\n"
"-       value_to_write = tl.full([BLOCK_SIZE], value, dtype=input_vals.dtype)\n"
"+       value_to_write = tl.full([BLOCK_SIZE_SUB], value, dtype=input_vals.dtype)\n"
"        overwrite_vals = tl.where(fill_mask_vals, value_to_write, tl.load(out + offsets, mask=mask, other=0))\n"
"        tl.store(out + offsets, overwrite_vals, mask=mask)"
msgstr ""
"@libentry()\n"
"@triton.autotune(configs=runtime.get_tuned_config(\"masked_fill\"), key=[\"N\"])\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"- def masked_fill_kernel(inp, expand_mask, value, out, N, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n"
"+ def masked_fill_kernel(inp, expand_mask, value, out, N, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr, BLOCK_SIZE_SUB: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)\n"
"+   base_offset = pid * BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"\n"
"+   # Compute the total number of blocks to process\n"
"+   num_sub_blocks = tl.cdiv(BLOCK_SIZE, BLOCK_SIZE_SUB)\n"
"\n"
"+   # Process each sub-block in a loop\n"
"+   for sub_block_idx in range(num_sub_blocks):\n"
"+       # Compute the offset of the current sub-block\n"
"+       sub_offset = base_offset + sub_block_idx * BLOCK_SIZE_SUB\n"
"+       offsets = sub_offset + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE_SUB)\n"
"-       offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"        mask = offsets < N\n"
"        # Load input and mask\n"
"        input_vals = tl.load(inp + offsets, mask=mask, other=0)\n"
"        fill_mask_vals = tl.load(expand_mask + offsets, mask=mask, other=0).to(tl.int1)\n"
"\n"
"        # Write the original input first\n"
"        tl.store(out + offsets, input_vals, mask=mask)\n"
"\n"
"        # Overlay and write value at the position that needs to be filled\n"
"-       value_to_write = tl.full([BLOCK_SIZE], value, dtype=input_vals.dtype)\n"
"+       value_to_write = tl.full([BLOCK_SIZE_SUB], value, dtype=input_vals.dtype)\n"
"        overwrite_vals = tl.where(fill_mask_vals, value_to_write, tl.load(out + offsets, mask=mask, other=0))\n"
"        tl.store(out + offsets, overwrite_vals, mask=mask)"

msgid "Triton Autotune 自动调优"
msgstr "Triton Autotune automatic tuning"

msgid ""
"在 Tiling "
"分块优化中，BLOCK_SIZE、BLOCK_SIZE_SUB等分块参数的取值直接影响算子性能，但手动调试参数组合效率低且难以找到最优值。triton.autotune是Triton框架提供的自动调优工具，能遍历预设的参数配置，通过实际运行对比性能，自动选择最优参数组合，是Tiling优化的核心配套手段。"
msgstr ""
"In Tiling optimization, the values of block parameters such as BLOCK_SIZE "
"and BLOCK_SIZE_SUB directly affect operator performance, but manually "
"debugging parameter combinations is inefficient and difficult to find the "
"optimal values. triton.autotune is an automatic tuning tool provided by the "
"Triton framework that can iterate over preset parameter configurations, "
"compare performance through actual execution, and automatically select the "
"optimal parameter combination, making it a core complementary approach to "
"Tiling optimization."

msgid ""
"如果你关注 Triton-Ascend 上 `configs=[]` 的推荐用法、自动 Tiling 的适用边界，可进一步参考 [Triton-"
"Ascend autotune 使用指南](../autotune_guide.md)。"
msgstr ""
"If you are interested in the recommended usage of `configs=[]` on Triton-"
"Ascend and the applicable boundaries of automatic Tiling, you can further "
"refer to the [Triton-Ascend autotune usage guide](../autotune_guide.md)."

msgid ""
"核心作用 自动遍历参数空间：针对BLOCK_SIZE、BLOCK_SIZE_SUB等 constexpr 类型的分块参数，批量测试不同取值的性能。 "
"性能基准对比：以算子的执行耗时为指标，筛选出适配当前硬件的最优参数。 缓存调优结果：调优后的最优配置会被缓存，后续调用算子时直接复用，避免重复调优。"
msgstr ""
"Core Function: Automatically traverse the parameter space: For constexpr-"
"type block parameters such as BLOCK_SIZE and BLOCK_SIZE_SUB, batch test the "
"performance of different values. Performance benchmark comparison: Use the "
"operator's execution time as the metric to filter out the optimal parameters"
" adapted to the current hardware. Cache tuning results: The optimal "
"configuration after tuning is cached and directly reused in subsequent "
"operator calls, avoiding repeated tuning."

msgid "简单示例"
msgstr "Simple example"

msgid ""
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"\n"
"@triton.autotune(\n"
"configs=[ # List of parameter configurations to test; candidate values need to be powers of 2\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 128}),\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 256}),\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 512}),\n"
"    ],\n"
"    key=['n_elements'], # Tuning dimension: the input dimension the parameter values depend on\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def add_kernel(x_ptr, y_ptr, output_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)\n"
"    block_start = pid * BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"    offsets = block_start + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"    mask = offsets < n_elements\n"
"\n"
"    x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    y = tl.load(y_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    output = x + y\n"
"    tl.store(output_ptr + offsets, output, mask=mask)"
msgstr ""
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"\n"
"@triton.autotune(\n"
"configs=[ # List of parameter configurations to test; candidate values need to be powers of 2\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 128}),\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 256}),\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 512}),\n"
"    ],\n"
"    key=['n_elements'], # Tuning dimension: the input dimension the parameter values depend on\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def add_kernel(x_ptr, y_ptr, output_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)\n"
"    block_start = pid * BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"    offsets = block_start + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"    mask = offsets < n_elements\n"
"\n"
"    x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    y = tl.load(y_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    output = x + y\n"
"    tl.store(output_ptr + offsets, output, mask=mask)"

msgid "注：设置以下环境变量，便可打印出最优参数信息。"
msgstr ""
"Note: Set the following environment variables to print out the optimal "
"parameter information."

msgid "export TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING=1"
msgstr "export TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING=1"

msgid "进阶：使用 max_autotune 自动调优"
msgstr "Advanced: Using max_autotune for Automatic Tuning"

msgid ""
"对于 Ascend NPU 算子，要想达到最优性能，除BLOCK_SIZE外，还需调优 "
"num_stages、enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance、tile_mix_vector_loop 等多个硬件相关参数。若使用 "
"@triton.autotune 手动枚举所有组合，会导致配置列表爆炸式增长，代码难以维护。"
msgstr ""
"For Ascend NPU operators, to achieve optimal performance, in addition to "
"BLOCK_SIZE, multiple hardware-related parameters such as num_stages, "
"enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance, and tile_mix_vector_loop also need to be tuned."
" If @triton.autotune is used to manually enumerate all combinations, the "
"configuration list will grow explosively, making the code difficult to "
"maintain."

msgid ""
"max_autotune 是专为 Ascend NPU 设计的扩展装饰器（位于 "
"triton.backends.ascend.runtime），允许用户仅提供基础配置，其余调优参数以列表形式传入，装饰器自动生成全部组合的 "
"Config 列表。"
msgstr ""
"max_autotune is an extended decorator specifically designed for Ascend NPU "
"(located in triton.backends.ascend.runtime), which allows users to provide "
"only the basic configuration while passing the remaining tuning parameters "
"as a list. The decorator automatically generates a list of Configs for all "
"combinations."

msgid ""
"核心作用 开发者只需提供少量基础配置（如BLOCK_SIZE），所有与该算子类型相关的编译器选项（例如 "
"num_stages、enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance、tile_mix_vector_loop、enable_ubuf_saving"
" 等）都会通过内置的合理默认值自动纳入最优组合的搜索范围，无需开发者显式列举，一次性完成最优 tiling "
"和编译器选项组合的自动寻优。若开发者希望对某些参数进行限定，也可通过显式传入列表来覆盖默认搜索范围。"
msgstr ""
"Core function: Developers only need to provide a small amount of basic "
"configuration (such as BLOCK_SIZE), and all compiler options related to this"
" operator type (e.g., num_stages, enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance, "
"tile_mix_vector_loop, enable_ubuf_saving, etc.) will be automatically "
"included in the search scope for the optimal combination through built-in "
"reasonable default values, without requiring developers to explicitly "
"enumerate them. This completes automatic optimization of the best tiling and"
" compiler option combination in one pass. If developers wish to constrain "
"certain parameters, they can also override the default search scope by "
"explicitly passing in a list."

msgid ""
"from triton.backends.ascend.runtime import max_autotune\n"
"\n"
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 128}),\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 256}),\n"
"    ],\n"
"    key=['n_elements'],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"vector\",           # Kernel type, supports cube/mix/vector\n"
"    enable_ubuf_saving=[True, False] # Optional; included by default\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def add_kernel(x_ptr, y_ptr, output_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr, **META):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)\n"
"    block_start = pid * BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"    offsets = block_start + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"    mask = offsets < n_elements\n"
"    x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    y = tl.load(y_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    output = x + y\n"
"    tl.store(output_ptr + offsets, output, mask=mask)"
msgstr ""
"from triton.backends.ascend.runtime import max_autotune\n"
"\n"
"@max_autotune(\n"
"    configs=[\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 128}),\n"
"        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 256}),\n"
"    ],\n"
"    key=['n_elements'],\n"
"    kernel_type=\"vector\",           # Kernel type, supports cube/mix/vector\n"
"    enable_ubuf_saving=[True, False] # Optional; included by default\n"
")\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def add_kernel(x_ptr, y_ptr, output_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr, **META):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)\n"
"    block_start = pid * BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"    offsets = block_start + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"    mask = offsets < n_elements\n"
"    x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    y = tl.load(y_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    output = x + y\n"
"    tl.store(output_ptr + offsets, output, mask=mask)"

msgid "如何在NPU上避免UB OVERFLOW"
msgstr "How to avoid UB OVERFLOW on NPU"

msgid "【描述】在NPU上，UB或者L1 Size存在上限，当出现该错误时，需要减少单次搬运的数据量，以for循环的方式处理长序列场景。"
msgstr ""
"【Description】On the NPU, there is an upper limit on the UB or L1 Size. When "
"this error occurs, it is necessary to reduce the amount of data transferred "
"in a single operation and handle long-sequence scenarios using a for-loop "
"approach."

